\" title=\"Unshackling Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Unshackling_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Unshackling_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Unshackling_Strike_Icon.webp/45px-Unshackling_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Unshackling_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Unshackling_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unshackling Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Unshackling_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Unshackling_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Unshackling_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Unshackling_Strike\" title=\"Unshackling Strike\">Unshackling Strike</a></span></li>\n</ul><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Immunity\"> Immunity </span></h2>\n<p>The following items grant immunity to all conditions in this status group:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement\" title=\"Elixir of Guileful Movement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\