=\"Freedom of Movement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp/30px-Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Freedom_of_Movement\" title=\"Freedom of Movement\">Freedom of Movement</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>The following passive features grant immunity to all conditions in this status group:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nature%27s_Step\" title=\"Nature's Step\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Generic_Nature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Nature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Generic_Nature_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Nature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Generic_Nature_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Nature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nature's Step\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Generic_Nature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Nature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Generic_Nature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nature%27s_Step\" title=\"Nature's Step\">Nature's Step</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>The following conditions grant immunity to all conditions in this status group:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbed_Essence:_Illasera_(Condition)\" title=\"Absorbed Essence: Illasera (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Absorbed Essence: Illasera\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Absorbed_Essence:_Illasera_(Condition)\" title=\"Absorbed Essence: Illasera (Condition)\">Absorbed Essence: Illasera</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_in_SG_Paralyzed\">List of conditions in SG_Paralyzed</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Command:_Halt\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Command:_Halt_(Condition)\" title=\"Command: Halt (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Command: Halt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Command:_Halt_(Condition)\" title=\"Command: Halt (Condition)\">Command: Halt</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Cannot move.</li>\n<li>Cannot take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Gossamer_Tomb\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gossamer_Tomb_(Condition)\" title=\"Gossamer Tomb (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gossamer Tomb\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gossamer_Tomb_(Condition)\" title=\"Gossamer Tomb (Condition)\">Gossamer Tomb</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This creature is entombed in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infested_(Condition)\" title=\"Infested (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Infested_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Infested_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Infested_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Infested_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Infested_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Infested_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infested\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Infested_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Infested_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Infested_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infested_(Condition)\" title=\"Infested (Condition)\">Infested</a> spider silk, and cannot move or take actions. Unless the silk is removed with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage, it will explode, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">10d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a><sup><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Gossamer_Tomb_(Condition)#Bugs\" title=\"Gossamer Tomb (Condition)\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> to the entombed creature.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Hold_Monster\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Monster_(Condition)\" title=\"Hold Monster (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Hold_Monster_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hold_Monster_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Hold_Monster_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hold_Monster_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Hold_Monster_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hold_Monster_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hold Monster\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Hold_Monster_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hold_Monster_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Hold_Monster_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Monster_(Condition)\" title=\"Hold Monster (Condition)\">Hold Monster</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity can't <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Move</a> or take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a>.</li>\n<li>Attacks against the entity have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>.</li>\n<li>Attacks against the entity are always <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hits</a> if the attacker is within 3 m (10 ft).</li>\n<li>Affected entity automatically fails all <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li>\n<li>At the end of each turn, the affected entity makes a <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>. On a successful save, the condition is removed.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Hold_Person\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Person_(Condition)\" title=\"Hold Person (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Hold_Person_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hold_Person_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Hold_Person_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hold_Person_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Hold_Person_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hold_Person_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hold Person\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Hold_Person_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hold_Person_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Hold_Person_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Person_(Condition)\" title=\"Hold Person (Condition)\">Hold Person</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity can't <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Move</a> or take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a>.</li>\n<li>Attacks against the entity automatically succeed their <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>.</li>\n<li>Attacks against the entity are always <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hits</a> if the attacker is within <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 3 m (10 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 3 m (10 ft).</li>\n<li>Affected entity automatically fails all <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li>\n<li>At the end of each turn, the affected entity makes a <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>. On a successful save, the condition is removed.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Infernal_Stun\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Stun_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Stun (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Stun\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Stun_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Stun (Condition)\">Infernal Stun</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This creature cannot move or act, and Raphael can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Drain\" title=\"Soul Drain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/25px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/38px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/50px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/25px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Drain\" title=\"Soul Drain\">Soul Drain</a> it at will.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Paralysed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\">Paralysed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity can't move or take <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Actions</a>, <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reactions</a>.</li>\n<li>Attacks against the entity are always <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit\" title=\"Critical hit\">critical hits</a> if the attacker is within 3 m (10 ft).</li>\n<li>Attack rolls against the entity have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>.</li>\n<li>Affected entity automatically fails all <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Strength and Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Paralysed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Karabasan%27s_Gift)_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Karabasan's Gift) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Karabasan%27s_Gift)_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Karabasan's Gift) (Condition)\">Paralysed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Creature is <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\">Incapacitated</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage.</li>\n<li>Automatically fails all <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a></li>\n<li>Any Attack Roll made against this creature by an attacker within 3 m (10 ft) automatically hits and is an automatic <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Stricken_with_Crawler_Mucus\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stricken_with_Crawler_Mucus_(Condition)\" title=\"Stricken with Crawler Mucus (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stricken with Crawler Mucus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Stricken_with_Crawler_Mucus_(Condition)\" title=\"Stricken with Crawler Mucus (Condition)\">Stricken with Crawler Mucus</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\">Paralysed</a></li>\n<li>Lasts until affected entity has made a successful <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Constitution Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement\" title=\"Elixir of Guileful Movement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement\" title=\"Elixir of Guileful Movement\">Elixir of Guileful Movement</a> can prevent paralysis, but its ability to remove it needs verification.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200417\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.146 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.156 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6538/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 92560/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18740/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.063/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1141173/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  116.433      1 -total\n 94.62%  110.172      1 Template:Status_group_page\n 35.06%   40.825      8 Template:Item_icon\n 19.21%   22.364     75 Template:Trim\n 17.92%   20.863     13 Template:Icon_link\n 16.99%   19.779     13 Template:Icon_text\n 12.47%   14.515      9 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 12.40%   14.442      8 Template:Conditions_table/row\n 11.60%   13.510     30 Template:Icon\n 11.25%   13.100     16 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34961-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200417 and revision id 330770. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}